<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?>
<LanguageData>
  <!--EN: Chain mail forged with an ancient design that provides above average physical defense. The design of the armor includes a symmetrical etching of arcane runes that bestow the wearer with enhanced power. Once crafted, these runes will attract an ancient spirit to embody the mail and grants the wearer a chance to cause additional arcane damage following any attack; however, this comes at a price - all abilities will require more energy to use, and the bearer is beset with nightmares that slowly break down mental resistances.
	
Ancient mail is enchanted and provides additional benefits to trained mages and fighters:
Max Energy: +8%
Energy Regen: +10%
Energy Costs: +15%
Arcane Resistance: +20%

Augmented by Arcane Spectre: 50% chance to deal 20% bonus damage-->
  <AncientMail.description>以古代技能锻造的锁子甲, 拥有着平均水平以上的物理防御能力. 此盔甲设计了一组对称的蚀刻符文槽. 经过打造后这些符文会为穿戴者吸引古代能量并给予穿戴者造成格外奥术伤害的机会; 然而那是有代价的 - 所有技能都会需要更多的法力来施放 (这个不能细说), 并且穿戴者会受困于梦魇中并缓慢降低精神抵抗力\n这件盔甲具有以下属性:\n最大能量：+ 8\n能量恢复：+ 10％\n技能消耗：+ 15％\n技能抗性：+ 20％\n魔法幽魂增强：50％几率造成20％的额外伤害</AncientMail.description>
  <!--EN: Ancient Mail-->
  <AncientMail.label>古代盔甲</AncientMail.label>
  <!--EN: A hood preferred by mages for its magical properties, light weight, and comfort. The method of infusing fabric with enchantments prior to weaving the hood returns improved enchanting results.

The Arcane Hood is enchanted and provides additional benefits to trained mages and fighters:
Max Energy: +10%
Energy Regen: +10%
Arcane Resistance: +10%-->
  <ArcaneHood.description>因其神奇特性、重量轻且舒适而深受法师青睐的兜帽。在编织兜帽之前向织物注入附魔的方法可改善附魔效果。

奥术兜帽具有魔力，可为训练有素的法师和战士提供额外的好处：
最大能量：+10%
能量再生：+10%
奥术抗性：+10%</ArcaneHood.description>
  <!--EN: Arcane Hood-->
  <ArcaneHood.label>奥术兜帽</ArcaneHood.label>
  <!--EN: Robes designed by a superior race that are meant for the highest class of magic users who are worthy of additional power and insight. These lightweight, flowing robes seem to propel the wearer as if carried by a great winged beast.

Robes of the Archmage are enchanted and provide additional benefits to trained mages and fighters:
Max Energy: +25
Energy Regen: +25%
Ability Cooldown: -20%
Energy Costs: -10%
Arcane Res: +15%
Ability Damage: +20%-->
  <ArchMageRobe.description>一件设计给最高级魔法师议会中长者的法袍. 它们十分轻便, 随风飘扬的部分像一只巨鸟身上的翅膀.\n\n这件长袍具有以下属性:\n最大能量+25\n能量恢复+20％\n技能冷却：-20％\n技能消耗：-10％\n经验增益：+25％\n技能抗性：+10％</ArchMageRobe.description>
  <!--EN: Robes of the Archmage-->
  <ArchMageRobe.label>奥术法师长袍</ArchMageRobe.label>
  <!--EN: Robes worn by the heralds of magic. Wearers of this robe demonstrate a willingness to make physical sacrifices to increase their innate power.
	
Mage robes are enchanted and provide additional benefits to trained mages and fighters:
Max Energy: +17.5%
Energy Regen: +10%
Ability Cooldown: -15%
Energy Costs: -15%
Class XP Gain: +10%
Arcane Power: +10%-->
  <DarkRobe.description>黑暗大魔法师所穿旧的长袍. 穿戴者会愿意牺牲自己的理智来换取神秘的力量.\n	\n这件长袍具有以下属性:\n最大能量：+17.5\n能量恢复：+10％\n技能冷却：-15％\n技能消耗：-15％\n经验增益：+10％\n技能抗性：+10％</DarkRobe.description>
  <!--EN: Mage Robe-->
  <DarkRobe.label>黑暗长袍</DarkRobe.label>
  <!--EN: A cloak heavily augmented by arcane power believed to have been first made for a black knight acting as the ambassador for an astral demon. The fabric is difficult to focus on in a way that can only be described as "visual noise" and the folds of cloth move in an unnatural way as if unrestrained by natural law. Those few who have worn this cloak in battle swear that it possesses a consciousness of its own and tell stories of the cloth shielding them from certain destruction.  Others claim those observations were nothing but hallucinations by deranged fools. Because of these claims, it is rumored that the cloak possesses the ability to completely mitigate attacks against the wearer, but no one has been able to reproduce these results with any reliability.

Robes of Supremacy are enchanted and provide additional benefits to trained mages and fighters:
Max Energy: +40%
Energy Regen: +40%
Ability Cooldown: -20%

Augmented by Phantom Shift: 20% chance to avoid an attack-->
  <DemonLordCloak.description>一件被大量奥术能量充斥的斗篷, 人们认为它第一次被打造出来的目的是给予一位前往精神世界与恶魔交涉的黑骑士. 其构造导致穿戴者很难被观察者注意到, 人们称之为是一种叫做“视觉噪音”的东西导致的. 并且衣服上的波纹会以不规则的方式运动着仿佛脱离了自然的束缚一般. 少数在战场上穿戴过长袍的人发誓说这件衣服拥有了自己的意识并告诉穿戴者它是如何庇护着他们从某一次毁灭性的灾难中逃生的. 但其他人宣称他们什么都没有观察到除了偶尔会出现疯子傻瓜一般的幻觉. 由于这些描述, 人们开始传播说这件长袍拥有使穿戴者完全不会受到伤害的能力, 但目前没有任何人有可靠的证据证明这种能力真的存在.\n这件长袍具有以下属性\n最大能量+40\n能量恢复+40％\n技能冷却-20％\n幻影之舞：20％几率闪避攻击</DemonLordCloak.description>
  <!--EN: Cloak of Supremacy-->
  <DemonLordCloak.label>霸者长袍</DemonLordCloak.label>
  <!--EN: A dark cowl that has a reputation of being cursed, though its magical properties are undeniable. Those who don this hood gain the ability to see manifestations of arcane energy and learn things they otherwise wouldn't. The hood's appearance and fear of revealed secrets lead most to distrust those who wear this hood. Likewise, those who see through the eyes of this hood begin to distrust those around them.

The Hood of Madness is enchanted and provides additional benefits to trained mages and fighters:
Class XP Gain: +30%
Arcane Resistance: 30%-->
  <HoodOfMadness.description>一件著名的受诅咒的黑色兜帽, 尽管它拥有神奇的力量. 戴上兜帽的人会得到看见奥术能量的能力并且学会他们原本无法学会的东西. 这件兜帽的外貌以及隐藏其后的恐怖秘密让大多数人都对兜帽的穿戴者抱以怀疑态度. 同样地, 隐藏在兜帽中的双眼在看向周围人时也会闪烁着不信任的光芒\n\n这件兜帽具有以下属性:\n经验增益: +30％\n技能抗性: +30％</HoodOfMadness.description>
  <!--EN: Hood of Madness-->
  <HoodOfMadness.label>黑暗兜帽</HoodOfMadness.label>
  <!--EN: A heavily enchanted helm meant to identify elite warriors of the Valiant.

Paragon's Helm is enchanted and provides additional benefits to trained mages and fighters:
Energy Costs: -5%
Class XP Gain: +15%
Max Energy: +5%
Arcane Res: +10%-->
  <ParagonHelm.description>专为精英勇士锻造的头盔。\n\n这件头盔具有以下属性\n技能消耗: -5％\n经验增益: +15％\n最大能量: +5％\n技能抗性: +10％</ParagonHelm.description>
  <!--EN: Paragon's Helm-->
  <ParagonHelm.label>帕拉贡战盔</ParagonHelm.label>
  <!--EN: A breastplate etched in holy symbols that is designed to protect vital areas without restricting movement. Said to have been worn by holy warriors of a bygone age who maintained peace with justice and compassion in equal measure. It is unknown what became of this order, though it is hard to believe it had anything to do with their skill in armor craft.

Armor of the Valiant is enchanted and provides additional benefits to trained mages and fighters:
Energy Costs: -10%
Class XP Gain: +10%-->
  <RoyalArmor.description>一件蚀刻着神圣符号的护胸甲, 它被设计用来保护关键部位并且不会影响到移动. 据说在过往的岁月里被一位维护正义与怜悯的圣战士穿戴至破旧不堪. 但之后发生的事情被掩埋在了历史的尘埃中, 只有这件盔甲流传了下来\n\n这件战铠具有以下属性:\n技能消耗：-10％\n经验增益：+10％</RoyalArmor.description>
  <!--EN: Armor of the Valiant-->
  <RoyalArmor.label>英勇战铠</RoyalArmor.label>
  <!--EN: A barbute shaped helm designed to maximize protection without restricting vision or voice. These helmets are a complementary piece to the Armor of the Valiant set and further enhance a wearers arcane capabilities while also providing noteworthy physical protection.

Helm of the Valiant is enchanted and provides additional benefits to trained mages and fighters:
Energy Costs: -5%
Class XP Gain: +10%-->
  <RoyalHelm.description>一种致命的头盔，旨在最大限度地保护，不会限制视觉或声音。 这些头盔是Valiant系列护甲的补充部分，进一步增强了佩戴者的神秘能力，同时还提供了值得注意的物理保护\n\n这件头盔具有以下属性:\n技能消耗: -5％\n经验增益: +10％</RoyalHelm.description>
  <!--EN: Helm of the Valiant-->
  <RoyalHelm.label>英勇头盔</RoyalHelm.label>
  <!--EN: cloak-->
  <TM_Cloak.label>「边魔」斗篷</TM_Cloak.label>
  <!--EN: Emblazoned with symbols and sigils that carry profound significance within the disciple's chosen path, this hood becomes a canvas for sacred artistry. Each stitch tells a tale of trials faced, wisdom gained, and the ongoing journey towards a higher plane of understanding. The hood serves not only as a physical covering but as a metaphysical barrier, shielding the disciple from distractions and worldly influences.

The Disiple Hood is enchanted and provides additional benefits to trained mages and fighters:
Max Energy: +25%
Energy Regen: +5%
Energy Costs: -5%
Class XP Gain: +10%
Arcane Resistance: +15%-->
  <TM_DiscipleHood.description>这顶兜帽饰有在弟子所选择的道路上具有深远意义的符号和印记，成为神圣艺术的画布。每一针都讲述了一个故事，讲述了所面临的考验、获得的智慧以及通往更高层次理解的持续旅程。兜帽不仅作为物理覆盖物，而且作为形而上学的屏障，保护弟子免受干扰和世俗的影响。
弟子兜帽具有魔力，可为受过训练的法师和战士提供额外的好处：
最大能量：+25%
能量再生：+5%
能源成本：-5%
等级 XP 增益：+10%
奥术抗性：+15%</TM_DiscipleHood.description>
  <!--EN: Disciple Hood-->
  <TM_DiscipleHood.label>门徒兜帽</TM_DiscipleHood.label>
  <!--EN: The uniform of an ardent disciple - this outfit is comprised of assorted pockets, pouches, and straps designed to allow the disciple to be prepared for any situation. Wearers of the disciple robe value protection and adaptability.
	
Disciple robes are enchanted and provide additional benefits to trained mages and fighters:
Max Energy: +20%
Energy Regen: +5%
Energy Costs: -5%
Class XP Gain: +10%
Arcane Res: +30%-->
  <TM_DiscipleRobe.description>热心弟子的制服 -这套服装由各种口袋、小袋和肩带组成，旨在让弟子为任何情况做好准备。弟子袍的穿着者看重保护和适应能力。

门徒长袍具有魔力，可为受过训练的法师和战士提供额外的好处：
最大能量：+20%
能量再生：+5%
能源成本：-5%
等级 XP 增益：+10%
奥术耐性：+30%</TM_DiscipleRobe.description>
  <!--EN: Disciple Robe-->
  <TM_DiscipleRobe.label>门徒长袍</TM_DiscipleRobe.label>
  <!--EN: This masterpiece of craftsmanship and resilience is a symphony of layered plates intricately layered over an armored mesh that offers unmatched protection. Gleaming rivets and jagged edges trace a pattern reminiscent of ethereal flames engulfing a fearless warrior. Forged in the crucible of peril, Dragon Slayer plate is a symbol of defiance against scaled tyrants that darken the sky and mechanical abominations that despoil the land. Infused with enchanted energies, the armor radiates magical might that acts as a guiding light - assuring that this warrior shall emerge victorious amidst fire and fang.

Dragon slayer Plate is enchanted and provides additional benefits to trained mages and fighters:
Max Energy: +30
Energy Regen: +20%
Ability Cooldown: -20%
Energy Costs: -20%
Arcane Res: +30%
Ability Damage: +30%-->
  <TM_DragonSlayer.description>这款工艺与韧性的杰作是分层板的交响曲，错综复杂地层叠在装甲网上，提供无与伦比的保护。闪闪发光的铆钉和锯齿状的边缘勾勒出一种图案，让人想起吞噬无畏战士的空灵火焰。屠龙者板甲是在危险的熔炉中锻造而成的，它是反抗使天空变得黑暗的鳞片暴君和掠夺大地的机械怪物的象征。盔甲注入了魔法能量，散发出神奇的力量，就像一盏指路明灯——确保这位战士在烈火和毒牙中取得胜利。
屠龙板甲具有魔力，可为训练有素的法师和战士提供额外的好处：
最大能量：+30
能量再生：+20%
技能冷却时间：-20%
能源成本：-20%
奥术抗性：+30%
技能伤害：+30%</TM_DragonSlayer.description>
  <!--EN: Dragon Slayer Plate-->
  <TM_DragonSlayer.label>屠龙板</TM_DragonSlayer.label>
  <!--EN: A patchwork buckskin of threaded leather adorned with animal memento and permeated with mystical energies. Primarily worn by tribal mystic leaders, the dreamcatcher buckskin represents the dream-like connection between nature and spirits. 
	
Mystics derive additional power from the symbolism of this outfit:
Max Energy: +40
Class XP Gain: +30%
Arcane Res: +25%-->
  <TM_DreamcatcherBuckskin.description>饰有动物纪念品的线状皮革拼凑而成的鹿皮衣服。主要由神秘主义部落的领袖穿着，追梦者服装代表了大自然和灵魂之间梦幻般的联系。\n\n神秘主义者从这套装备的象征意义中获得额外的力量：\n最大能量：+40\n经验增益:：+30%\n能量恢复：+25%-</TM_DreamcatcherBuckskin.description>
  <!--EN: Dreamcatcher Buckskin-->
  <TM_DreamcatcherBuckskin.label>捕梦者鹿皮衣服</TM_DreamcatcherBuckskin.label>
  <!--EN: A patchwork headdress of animal leather topped with a majestic crown of antlers. This hood marks the bearer as the spiritual leader of a tribe. The dreamcatcher raiment is said to grant gifted users with the ability to view nature through the eyes of their spirit animal.

Mystics derive additional power from the symbolism of this outfit:
Max Energy: +25
Class XP Gain: +20%
Arcane Res: +20%-->
  <TM_DreamcatcherCoronet.description>一种由动物皮革拼凑而成的头饰，顶部有雄伟的鹿角王冠。这个王冠标志着持有者是一个部落的精神领袖。据说，追梦者服装赋予超凡者通过精神动物的眼睛观察自然的能力。\n\n神秘主义者从这套服装的象征意义中获得额外的力量：\n最大能量：+25\n经验增益:：+20%\n能量恢复：+20%</TM_DreamcatcherCoronet.description>
  <!--EN: Dreamcatcher Coronet-->
  <TM_DreamcatcherCoronet.label>追梦者冠冕</TM_DreamcatcherCoronet.label>
  <!--EN: A simple hood that increases protection, both magical and mundane. The method of infusing fabric with enchantments prior to weaving the hood returns improved enchanting results.

The Hood of Protection is enchanted and provides additional benefits to trained mages and fighters:
Arcane Resistance: +10%-->
  <TM_HoodOfProtection.description>一款简单的兜帽，可增加魔法和普通的保护。在编织兜帽之前向织物注入附魔的方法可改善附魔效果。

保护兜帽具有魔力，可为受过训练的法师和战士提供额外的好处：
奥术抗性：+10%</TM_HoodOfProtection.description>
  <!--EN: Hood of Protection-->
  <TM_HoodOfProtection.label>防护兜帽</TM_HoodOfProtection.label>
  <!--EN: A cloak designed for traveling mages that provides protection against the elements and improves energy recovery rates. The method of infusing arcane gemstones into the fabric during crafting yields unparalleled enchantment effectiveness.
	
This cloak is enchanted and provides additional benefits to trained mages:
Max Energy: +12%
Ability Cooldown: -20%
Arcane Resistance: +5%-->
  <TM_MaestersCloak.description>一个为旅行法师设计的斗篷, 用来提供魔法防护和加快奥术能量恢复速度. 此物品在打造过程中使用了特殊的宝石附魔方式使其拥有了很强的附魔效果\n这款斗篷具有以下属性：\n最大能量: +12\n技能冷却: -20％\n技能抗性: +5％</TM_MaestersCloak.description>
  <!--EN: Wanderer's Cloak-->
  <TM_MaestersCloak.label>漫游者斗篷</TM_MaestersCloak.label>
  <!--EN: A loose, cape-like coat worn over other garments and offering added protection against weather and other hazards. The Mantle of Protection is magically infused with warding runes to further its defense. The method of infusing arcane gemstones into the fabric during crafting yields unparalleled enchantment effectiveness.
	
This cloak is enchanted and provides additional benefits to trained mages:
Class XP Gain: +20%
Arcane Resistance: +30%-->
  <TM_MantleOfProtection.description>一件宽松的斗篷式外套，穿在其他衣服外面，提供额外的保护，抵御天气和其他危险。保护斗篷神奇地注入了守护符文，以增强其防御能力。在制作过程中将奥术宝石注入织物的方法产生了无与伦比的附魔效果。

这件斗篷具有魔力，可为受过训练的法师提供额外的好处：
等级 XP 增益：+20%
奥术抗性：+30%</TM_MantleOfProtection.description>
  <!--EN: Mantle of Protection-->
  <TM_MantleOfProtection.label>保护斗篷</TM_MantleOfProtection.label>
  <!--EN: This dark and mystical ensemble is crafted with a macabre elegance, blending bone motifs and shadowy enchantments to provide both protection and serve as a conduit for the necromancer's unholy powers. The Shroud of the Soulreaper is a testament to the necromancer's mastery over the forces of death, shrouding them in an aura of ominous power as they manipulate the very fabric of life and afterlife. While the shroud may be worn by anyone, its unique properties improve the necromancer's control over the undead.
	
Necromancers derive additional power from the symbolism of this dark garment:
Max Energy: +40
Energy Regen: +30%
Arcane Power: +30%

Shroud of Undeath: reduces undead upkeep costs by 30% for this necromancer and increases movement and attack power by 15% for nearby undead-->
  <TM_Necromancer_Body.description>这套黑暗而神秘的套装具有令人毛骨悚然的优雅，融合了骨头图案和阴暗结界，既提供保护，又充当死灵法师邪恶力量的渠道。灵魂收割者裹尸布是死灵法师对死亡力量的掌控的证明，当他们操纵生命和来世的结构时，将他们笼罩在不祥力量的光环之中。虽然任何人都可以佩戴裹尸布，但其独特的特性可以提高死灵法师对不死生物的控制力。
死灵法师从这件深色服装的象征意义中获得额外的力量：
最大能量：+40
能量再生：+30%
奥术力量：+30%

亡灵裹尸布：使该死灵法师的亡灵维护成本降低 30%，并使附近亡灵的移动力和攻击力提高 15%</TM_Necromancer_Body.description>
  <!--EN: Shroud of the Soulreaper-->
  <TM_Necromancer_Body.label>灵魂收割者裹尸布</TM_Necromancer_Body.label>
  <!--EN: This ominous garment is woven from shadowy fabrics and imbued with dark enchantments, concealing the visage of the necromancer beneath a mask of cloth and bone. The Cowl of the Soulreaper serves not only as a practical accessory to shield the wearer from prying eyes but also as a symbolic manifestation of the necromancer's communion with the realms beyond life. Its eerie aura and sinister design make it a fitting adornment for those who harness the powers of the undead and tread the paths of necromantic arts.

Necromancers derive additional power from the symbolism of this item:
Max Energy: +20
Energy Regen: +5%

Shroud of Undeath: reduces undead upkeep costs by 20% for this necromancer and increases movement and attack power by 10% for nearby undead-->
  <TM_Necromancer_Hood.description>这件不祥的服装由阴暗的织物编织而成，充满了黑暗的魔力，将死灵法师的面容隐藏在布和骨头的面具下。灵魂收割者兜帽不仅是保护佩戴者免受窥探的实用配饰，也是死灵法师与生命之外的领域交流的象征。其怪异的光环和险恶的设计使其成为那些驾驭亡灵力量并踏上死灵艺术之路的人的完美装饰品。

死灵法师从该物品的象征意义中获得额外的力量：
最大能量：+20
能量再生：+5%

亡灵裹尸布：使该死灵法师的亡灵维持成本降低 20%，并使附近亡灵的移动力和攻击力提高 10%</TM_Necromancer_Hood.description>
  <!--EN: Cowl of the Soulreaper-->
  <TM_Necromancer_Hood.label>灵魂收割者兜帽</TM_Necromancer_Hood.label>
  <!--EN: Crafted with an eerie elegance, this disconcerting mask combines dark materials and arcane symbols, concealing the necromancer's countenance behind a haunting facade. Its eerie aura and sinister design make it a fitting adornment for those who harness the powers of undeath and tread the paths of necromantic arts.

Necromancers derive additional power from the symbolism of this item:
